      "created_at": "2014-08-28T22:24:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><span>Announcing&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sentinelsOTM\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sentinels of the Multiverse</a><span>&nbsp;Organized Play!&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Games By James:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/SouthdaleCenter\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Southdale Center</a><span>- October 2, 2014 @ 6:00PM&nbsp;</span><br><span>Games By James:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.burnsvillecenter.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Burnsville Center</a>- October 9, 2014 @ 6:00PM</span></p><p><br><span>Event Fee: $5/player</span></p><p><br><span>Prize Support: PROMO CARDS!!!<br><br>Yes, that's right, we're giving away sets of the Dark Watch promo cards to winning teams. So grab your friends and get ready to defend the multiverse!&nbsp;</span><br>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span>Format and Rules...<br><br>At least one player for a team must have a copy of The Sentinels of the Multiverse (or the Enhanced Edition). Copies of heroes, decks, environments, or villains will not be provided.&nbsp;<br><br>Players will seat themselves at tables with no more than four players to a team. If you do not have four people, you may be asked to seat someone from another group to fill out your numbers.&nbsp;<br><br>Each player can select a hero of their choice- hero promo cards and proxies of hero promo cards will be considered to be playable if they are accurate. There may be no more than one of any hero at a given table. A player may only use one hero at a time- so no two-handed playing. Players may select heroes from expansion sets.&nbsp;<br><br>Players will be playing two rounds with this group of heroes. The heroes will heal back to full health at the start of each round.&nbsp;<br><br>The TO will roll a die to determine the environment and the villain that they will face each round. Villains and environments will only be drawn from the base set of Sentinels of the Multiverse.&nbsp;<br><br>If your table wins either round, you receive a set of the Dark Watch promo cards! No more than one set will be given out per team. Limit of 10 sets per event. &nbsp;<br><br>See you there, heroes!</span></p>",
