      "raw": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Announcing&nbsp;</span><a data-hovercard=\"/ajax/hovercard/page.php?id=135023009907241\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sentinelsOTM\" style=\"color: rgb(59, 89, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Sentinels of the Multiverse</a><span style=\"color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;Organized Play!&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Games By James:&nbsp;<a data-hovercard=\"/ajax/hovercard/page.php?id=150041787716\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/SouthdaleCenter\" style=\"color: rgb(59, 89, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Southdale Center</a><span style=\"color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">- October 2, 2014 @ 6:00PM&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Games By James:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.burnsvillecenter.com/\">Burnsville Center</a>- October 9, 2014 @ 6:00PM</span></p><p><br style=\"color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Event Fee: $5/player</span></p><p><br /><span class=\"text_exposed_show\" style=\"display: inline; color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Prize Support: PROMO CARDS!!!<br /><br />Yes, that&#39;s right, we&#39;re giving away sets of the Dark Watch promo cards to winning teams. So grab your friends and get ready to defend the multiverse!&nbsp;</span><br />&nbsp;</p><p><br /><span class=\"text_exposed_show\" style=\"display: inline; color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Format and Rules...<br /><br />At least one player for a team must have a copy of The Sentinels of the Multiverse (or the Enhanced Edition). Copies of heroes, decks, environments, or villains will not be provided.&nbsp;<br /><br />Players will seat themselves at tables with no more than four players to a team. If you do not have four people, you may be asked to seat someone from another group to fill out your numbers.&nbsp;<br /><br />Each player can select a hero of their choice- hero promo cards and proxies of hero promo cards will be considered to be playable if they are accurate. There may be no more than one of any hero at a given table. A player may only use one hero at a time- so no two-handed playing. Players may select heroes from expansion sets.&nbsp;<br /><br />Players will be playing two rounds with this group of heroes. The heroes will heal back to full health at the start of each round.&nbsp;<br /><br />The TO will roll a die to determine the environment and the villain that they will face each round. Villains and environments will only be drawn from the base set of Sentinels of the Multiverse.&nbsp;<br /><br />If your table wins either round, you receive a set of the Dark Watch promo cards! No more than one set will be given out per team. Limit of 10 sets per event. &nbsp;<br /><br />See you there, heroes!</span></p>",
