      "created_at": "2014-08-28T23:44:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The team gets the cards to break up as they'd like. &nbsp;In our experience, usually one person has a copy of the game and everyone else just uses that- so we wanted to offer prize support conducive to that system. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for the question, we hope to see you at one of our events. &nbsp;</p>",
