      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Sentinels Fans of the Twin Cities! &nbsp;I have dire news and urgent announcemnets. &nbsp;</p><p>First, the events are being pushed back a bit due to a scheduling snafu. &nbsp;</p><p>The Southdale event will now be on October 2nd, and the Burnsville event will now be on October 9th. &nbsp;</p><p>We apologize whole-heartedly for any inconveinance this may cause you. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, to answer a couple concerns:&nbsp;</p><p>Each table fights the same villain each round, so Baron Blade would be removed from the pool after being defeated. &nbsp;We are only using base set villains since not every fan has each expansion. &nbsp;</p><p>The promo cards are the Dark Watch series, which is a set of 6 (4 heores, 2 villains). &nbsp;We are leaving it to the players to determine how to divide them amongst themselves as we do not have enough to give every player who attends a set. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We hope to see you Thursday!</p>",
