      "id": 116652,
      "name": "shadowfistminnesota",
      "username": "shadowfistminnesota",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/65b543/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-28T18:12:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Argh!&nbsp; Is there any chance of getting one of these moved back to a weekend?&nbsp; My family and I have been fired up for this for that last month or so.&nbsp; We recruited a full team to come play, and my wife and son were particularly looking forward to this as they'd never participated in a public gaming event before.&nbsp; However, a Thursday night event is completely out for us due to my wife's class schedule, and any weeknight is challenging due my son's school commitments.&nbsp; Weeknights also torpedo the other adult in our team as he works until 7 most weeknights.</p><p>Is there anyone else who would strongly prefer a weekend event?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
